    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Backtracking</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Grid DFS</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/word-search/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 79</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Word Search</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Try every cell as a start and extend the path one letter at a time with DFS; mark the cell while it is on the path and unmark it on the way back. Two cheap checks (enough letters on the board, start from the rarer end) kill most hopeless searches. O(m·n·3<sup>L</sup>) worst case, O(L) stack.</p>\n"
